          "gu_golden_needle_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He says golden needle Gu combined with puppet control Gu can take control of living bodies. He says that when he was forty-two and his cultivation had advanced to rank four peak stage, he ended closed cultivation and began to roam to test his skills. At Tie Mu mountain, a group of over fifty demonic path mountain bandits attacked him. He used this move to make thirty-eight of them defect, then captured all of them and got rid of those evil beings.",
